    "title": "打印报价单",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><strong>操作步骤：</strong></p>\n<p>1.设置-打印设置-设置报价单的打印模板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202306/0a486ddd8e53c59d5c79c3380f979ca6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>2.开报价单界面底部有保存后打印的按钮，勾选后保存单据后会自动打印，默认是不勾选的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202306/ef911915c17b9421fc76968dd30f7738.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>3.查看报价单，右上角点击打印，然后选择打印模板，可以点击预览或者点打印。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202306/a8be16d690e9f2bfdcbb42713dd2d8c5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n",
